Features.Links.Index
  SimpleStack
    Header 2|Links Index
    Text
      Text:
        I’m a standalone IntraWeb page, living free and linkable like any regular HTML page. IWML files can also be summoned
        with an HTML link and a ? parameter, but if you want a minimalized link you give each IWML file its own .html buddy.
        Sure, each IWML file can still have code behind it, but forget about the fancy shared IntraWeb 17 state magic.
        You’re back in caveman times with plain old JavaScript integration. So grab your local state, cookies, and parameters,
        because without IntraWeb’s built-in brain, you’re going to be managing your own memory like it’s 1999.
    gap
    Link Page2 via HTML|Page2.html
    Link Page2 via Param|Index.html?Page2
